es when it gets dark-all players get an identity verification opportunity  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶ Each round is a 15-20 minute high-intensity psychological game  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ▶ Supports 4-player online confrontation, and each round randomly obtains a unique identity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶ Special execution animations that make people feeling hot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > [Character Introduction]  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👧[Saori]  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/4e888474992409593fd764b33b89d2ec.avif?t=1766720842\" width=612 height=1104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > She looks innocent and a good girl in the eyes of people around her. No one would have thought of her true identity - a vampire! Or rather, everyone who knew this secret disappeared quietly.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 👮‍♀️[Vela Kolt]  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/9bcc9cac61450087f76206b53a75820e.avif?t=1766720842\" width=612 height=1104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everyone thinks that this policewoman is too strong, but they don't know that she has a masochistic habit in private. Her true identity is a wolf hidden among humans. When she is emotional, her ears and tail will be exposed.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪡[Nicky]  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/04e770e7ee3985441f